<title>JAPAN: Japan May service price index rises 1.4 yr/yr -- BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan May service price index rises 1.4 yr/yr -- BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) rose 1.4 percent in May from a year earlier but fell 0.1 percent from a month earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The overall index stood at 103.6 for May. The index tracks price movements in the service industry and uses 1990 as its base year.  </p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year and month-on-month for May:</p>
<p>			    YEAR-ON-YEAR	    MONTH-ON-MONTH</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance     +0.4			-0.4</p>
<p> Real estate	     +1.3			 0.0</p>
<p> Transport		 +1.8			-0.1</p>
<p> Information services  +2.6			-0.1</p>
<p> Communications	  -0.2			-0.1</p>
<p> Advertising services  +3.1			-0.8</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -2.7			+0.3</p>
<p> Other services	  +2.3			+0.1</p>
</text>
